# Third-party files (the references/ of ub-mode, find-skills, the discover-* gateways and the ECC
# reviewer checklists) must stay byte-identical to upstream (sha256 checked by tests): no line-ending conversion and no
# whitespace checks. Our wrapper SKILL.md files are normal text.
skills/ub-mode/references/** -text -whitespace
skills/find-skills/references/** -text -whitespace
skills/discover-*/references/** -text -whitespace
skills/verify-and-stop/references/ecc-reviewers/** -text -whitespace
